{"sentences": [{"t": 0.1, "d": 3.7125, "text": "This is khtop \u2014 the terminal dashboard for KeeperHub."}, {"t": 3.7625, "d": 5.6, "text": "One screen, always on: workflows, executions, your wallet \u2014 live."}, {"t": 9.3625, "d": 6.1375, "text": "KeeperHub keeps onchain agents alive \u2014 retries, gas handling, audit trails."}, {"t": 15.5, "d": 4.6, "text": "But the only way to see it is the web app. khtop puts it all on one screen."}, {"t": 20.1, "d": 6.3625, "text": "Every run, every step: trigger, simulation, submitted transaction, gas used."}, {"t": 26.4625, "d": 3.2875, "text": "When a run fails, the error is right there."}, {"t": 29.75, "d": 2.4625, "text": "And it executes onchain."}, {"t": 32.2125, "d": 6.8, "text": "Press t, enter an amount \u2014 khtop simulates first, catching reverts before anything broadcasts."}, {"t": 39.0125, "d": 6.1875, "text": "Confirm, and KeeperHub handles idempotent execution, gas, the full audit trail."}, {"t": 45.2, "d": 4.5875, "text": "Here's the transaction \u2014 live on Sepolia, real and linkable."}, {"t": 49.7875, "d": 3.2625, "text": "khtop \u2014 the ops view your agents deserve."}], "words": [{"w": "This", "t": 0.1, "d": 0.33}, {"w": "is", "t": 0.43000000000000005, "d": 0.165}, {"w": "khtop", "t": 0.5950000000000001, "d": 0.4125}, {"w": "\u2014", "t": 1.0075, "d": 0.0825}, {"w": "the", "t": 1.09, "d": 0.2475}, {"w": "terminal", "t": 1.3375000000000001, "d": 0.66}, {"w": "dashboard", "t": 1.9975, "d": 0.7425}, {"w": "for", "t": 2.74, "d": 0.2475}, {"w": "KeeperHub.", "t": 2.9875000000000003, "d": 0.825}, {"w": "One", "t": 3.7625, "d": 0.3}, {"w": "screen,", "t": 4.0625, "d": 0.7}, {"w": "always", "t": 4.7625, "d": 0.6}, {"w": "on:", "t": 5.3625, "d": 0.3}, {"w": "workflows,", "t": 5.6625, "d": 1.0}, {"w": "executions,", "t": 6.6625, "d": 1.0999999999999999}, {"w": "your", "t": 7.762499999999999, "d": 0.39999999999999997}, {"w": "wallet", "t": 8.1625, "d": 0.6}, {"w": "\u2014", "t": 8.7625, "d": 0.099999999999999